#Ideas Empowerment Platform — Detailed Implementation Plan
##Executive Summary
This plan is based on a deep analysis of the current codebase (35+ source files, 19 unit tests, 1 E2E test, 6 CI jobs), the README's stated vision, and extensive market research across AI code generation platforms (Bolt.new, v0.dev, Lovable.dev, Cloudflare VibeSDK) and enterprise innovation management platforms (Brightidea, IdeaScale, HYPE Innovation).

The platform occupies a unique intersection: it's an AI vibe-coding platform (prompt → full-stack app) purpose-built for enterprise innovation empowerment (turning employee ideas into tangible PoCs). The plan below bridges these two worlds — strengthening the core coding engine while adding the collaboration, governance, and lifecycle features that enterprises need.

